    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I understand how logical that can feel when you’re drowning in pain, but I promise you—it’s not the truth. Your family doesn’t need a perfect provider, they need you—the person who loves them enough to worry like this. The “weight” you feel isn’t who you are; it’s the depression lying to you, and it’s a lie that can be treated. Please don’t make a permanent decision based on a temporary, distorted view—call or text 988 right now, and let someone sit with you in this. They want you here, not just your absence.",
